; Construct actual reciprocal witnesses for every nonzero rational.
; Use the signed numerator magnitude and its proved nonzero natural
; witness. Elimination of magnitude existence has a Prop-valued result;
; no quotient, field inverse, choice or excluded-middle axiom is added.
; A unit is equivalent to nonzero under the proved cross equivalence.
(#alias multiply = ./../fermat_statement.lim::multiply)
(#alias exists = ./logic-exists.lim::exists)
(#alias conjunction = ./logical-connectives.lim::conjunction)
(#alias conjunction-introduce = ./logical-connectives.lim::conjunction-introduce)
(#alias disjunction-eliminate = ./logical-connectives.lim::disjunction-eliminate)
